What: Context Aware Sparse LM Head
Upstream: https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59740 by @stecasta (open), ported at head 3ed5c097 (PR now at 6160ed72); ported by hand onto this series, plus a hook that hands the sparse draft head a BF16 copy of the block-FP8 shared head, which the PR's head refuses.
